<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>net8.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <LangVersion>preview</LangVersion>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <InvariantGlobalization>false</InvariantGlobalization>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>true</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
    <Version>1.6.0</Version>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
      A prefixed name in an element()/attribute() kind test (e.g. self::attribute(x:expand-text), where x is declared on an ancestor xsl:* element) now resolves its prefix against the stylesheet's namespaces and matches the intended nodes, instead of raising a spurious XPST0081 at parse time (reported by Martin Honnen, running XSpec). Streaming (XSLT 3.0 §19 posture/sweep): a large batch of streamable xsl:copy / xsl:copy-of / copy-of() / snapshot() shapes now stream correctly — a for-each of streamed attributes captured into a typed attribute()* variable; mixed streamed+grounded for-each selects; copy-namespaces="yes" preserving ancestor in-scope namespaces on a copied streamed element; a leading copy-of(path)/snapshot(path) for-each select; a nested/navigating xsl:copy select that must buffer; and apply-templates select="copy-of()" switching modes on the matched subtree (Saxon bug 2630). Document nodes constructed into element content transmit their content (concatenated) rather than being atomized/space-separated, while the same nodes captured into a variable and atomized keep separation. Requires PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.3.0 and PhoenixmlDb.XQuery 1.6.1. No breaking API changes. See RELEASES.md for full notes.
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);CS1591</NoWarn>
    <EnforceCodeStyleInBuild>true</EnforceCodeStyleInBuild>
    <AnalysisLevel>latest-all</AnalysisLevel>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup>
    <Authors>Endpoint Systems</Authors>
    <Company>Endpoint Systems</Company>
    <Product>PhoenixmlDb</Product>
    <Copyright>Copyright © Endpoint Systems 2026. All rights reserved.</Copyright>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/phoenixmldb/phoenixmldb-xslt</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://phoenixml.dev</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>Apache-2.0</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageIcon>icon.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>PACKAGE.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)icon.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
    <None Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)PACKAGE.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)' == 'Release'">
    <DebugType>embedded</DebugType>
    <DebugSymbols>true</DebugSymbols>
    <Deterministic>true</Deterministic>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
